      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the conversation, using the following words.</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"/images/exams/set_1_-_electronic_devices_6ec2eab6.png\" alt width=\"500\"></strong></p>\n<p>Tom: Hey, Sarah! Is that the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.1</label><input id='fbo-909984-0' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='0' name='fbo-909984-0' type='text' size='25' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-909984-0' /></span></strong> you've recently bought?</p>\n<p>Sarah: That's right! It&#8217;s very handy!</p>\n<p>Tom: That&#8217;s cool! Is it made of <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.2</label><input id='fbo-909984-1' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='1' name='fbo-909984-1' type='text' size='8' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-909984-1' /></span></strong>?</p>\n<p>Sarah: Yes, most of it. It&#8217;s light and easy to carry around. It also has many colors to choose.</p>\n<p>Tom: I see. Do you know if any parts are made from other materials?</p>\n<p>Sarah: Actually, the buttons are made from<strong> <span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.3</label><input id='fbo-909984-2' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='2' name='fbo-909984-2' type='text' size='13' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-909984-2' /></span></strong>. It makes them strong and durable.</p>\n<p>Tom: That&#8217;s interesting. What about the wires inside?</p>\n<p>Sarah: The wires inside are made from <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.4</label><input id='fbo-909984-3' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='3' name='fbo-909984-3' type='text' size='7' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-909984-3' /></span></strong>&nbsp;because it is conductive.</p>\n<p>Tom: I never realized how many materials are used in these devices!</p>",
